{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/d1930271a5030713d5705b12dba4a9ac.poster.avif?t=1768921841\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/d1930271a5030713d5705b12dba4a9ac.webm?t=1768921841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/d1930271a5030713d5705b12dba4a9ac.mp4?t=1768921841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nullis</strong> is a puzzle game where the goal is to destroy zeros from the board. To destroy all of 0-s you must align symbols by getting rid of those below them. Plan your moves ahead or try out different outcomes in order to complete levels with optimal solutions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are different kinds of symbols:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 - must be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - can never be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubits - different behavior, e.g. destroy within x steps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/cfd00d664644618dada8a91c006480e6.poster.avif?t=1768921841\" width=334 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/cfd00d664644618dada8a91c006480e6.webm?t=1768921841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/cfd00d664644618dada8a91c006480e6.mp4?t=1768921841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes over 100 handcrafted levels across <strong>three different difficulties</strong>. Complete each level with optimal amount of moves to earn stars.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952000?t=1768921841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/d14ef9c116a383f8932d47b5514a763b3c6119bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768921841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/f8403835b7659c5b522c00339bc9e9aed01f3f11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768921841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/f8403835b7659c5b522c00339bc9e9aed01f3f11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768921841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/d1930271a5030713d5705b12dba4a9ac.poster.avif?t=1768921841\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/d1930271a5030713d5705b12dba4a9ac.webm?t=1768921841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass